    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre and theme:</strong> Vertical scroll shooter sci-fi space combat game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game mechanics:</strong> Shoot, dodge, collect power-ups, fight bosses, complete missions. Progress through 25 levels, combat 75 different enemy types. Pilot your spaceship, shoot down enemies, avoid incoming fire, and collect upgrades. Each level features unique objectives and difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core appeal:</strong> Intense action, strategic analysis, and progressive difficulty. The game builds challenge across 25 levels while introducing new enemy types and mechanics. Pixel-perfect collision detection and varied enemy AI ensure deep gameplay experience.</p>",
